(5589237, 808420, 107736, '<td valign="top">Not realistic enough to convince me of a fluid scene.</td>', 'Not realistic enough to convince me of a fluid scene.', '2009-07-28 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589238, 807821, 107736, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty good. The use of the mirror has allowed the photographer to create an image that shows a fluid scene with the exception of the chair seat and the chair legs.</td>', 'This one is pretty good. The use of the mirror has allowed the photographer to create an image that shows a fluid scene with the exception of the chair seat and the chair legs.', '2009-07-28 18:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589239, 808584, 107736, '<td valign="top">Pretty ingenius. Again the use of a mirror is helping the picture have a fluid scene and the use of the different subject items does not hold the illusion back.</td>', 'Pretty ingenius. Again the use of a mirror is helping the picture have a fluid scene and the use of the different subject items does not hold the illusion back.', '2009-07-28 18:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589241, 808068, 107736, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any oneness in this.</td>', 'I don''t see any oneness in this.', '2009-07-28 18:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589242, 807750, 107736, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the tower this photo would have been a keeper. The rainbow flows right into the clouds and then the clouds shift and change in color and appearance but still gives the illusion of a fluid scene.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the tower this photo would have been a keeper. The rainbow flows right into the clouds and then the clouds shift and change in color and appearance but still gives the illusion of a fluid scene.', '2009-07-28 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589244, 808614, 107736, '<td valign="top">This photo flows pretty good too with the exception of the color tones separating the two objects. If the color tones matched this would have been a great illusional photo of two objects blending to make a fluid scene.</td>', 'This photo flows pretty good too with the exception of the color tones separating the two objects. If the color tones matched this would have been a great illusional photo of two objects blending to make a fluid scene.', '2009-07-28 18:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589246, 808641, 107736, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one is pretty cool. The position of the cell phone pic is pretty much on target. But it is not a perfect fluid scene. The tones are different and the right eye is more open than the left eye giving the image two distinct pictures of the eye.</td>', 'Wow, this one is pretty cool. The position of the cell phone pic is pretty much on target. But it is not a perfect fluid scene. The tones are different and the right eye is more open than the left eye giving the image two distinct pictures of the eye.', '2009-07-28 18:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589247, 808608, 107736, '<td valign="top">No on this one.</td>', 'No on this one.', '2009-07-28 18:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589248, 808488, 107736, '<td valign="top">I really like this one and the title fits. Great fluid scence.</td>', 'I really like this one and the title fits. Great fluid scence.', '2009-07-28 18:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589249, 808668, 107736, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. Fish mouth on the right is a tad to close to the nose taking away from the eye so the image doesn''t really flow to good. But it''s still pretty good I think.</td>', 'Pretty good. Fish mouth on the right is a tad to close to the nose taking away from the eye so the image doesn''t really flow to good. But it''s still pretty good I think.', '2009-07-28 18:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589251, 808626, 107736, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. But I don''t see the fluid scene connecting the two separate objects.</td>', 'Nice shot. But I don''t see the fluid scene connecting the two separate objects.', '2009-07-28 18:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589253, 808599, 107736, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty good. Even the lines in the fingers show definition and they are positioned great to show one fluid scene.</td>', 'This one is pretty good. Even the lines in the fingers show definition and they are positioned great to show one fluid scene.', '2009-07-28 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
