(5589620, 808628, 67697, '<td valign="top">This looks like one done by a Topaz fan.  I want to say <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70661" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Doyle</a> but I am not sure.  What a great composition.  The boat thing is fun but I like the added bonus of the family in the picture too.  Great shot!</td>', 'This looks like one done by a Topaz fan.  I want to say  Doyle but I am not sure.  What a great composition.  The boat thing is fun but I like the added bonus of the family in the picture too.  Great shot!', '2009-07-28 23:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
