(5589732, 807552, 93283, '<td valign="top">Wow, I will be the first to admit that I totally missed the magazine in this shot. I even spent an extra moment looking this shot over because I liked the pose so much. Even after viewing it for the third time, I did not notice the magazine until I read the comments and looked closer. Anyway, great shot, excellent blend, and I formally apologize for voting this image lower than I should have...</td>', 'Wow, I will be the first to admit that I totally missed the magazine in this shot. I even spent an extra moment looking this shot over because I liked the pose so much. Even after viewing it for the third time, I did not notice the magazine until I read the comments and looked closer. Anyway, great shot, excellent blend, and I formally apologize for voting this image lower than I should have...', '2009-07-29 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 0),
