(6066249, 807616, 100901, '<td valign="top">Wow, have no looked here in along time! Thanks for the review and the heads up. I did not read the challenge properly so your right on that and I apologise for that. Oh and it did not squirt as I was anticipating this to while the moving car was moving even closer to it. I also did not have much time to alter camera settings and it sure was not in the my menu settings on the 450d I use. I have more on flickr.com/gipukan/ but getting close to this bird is really hard in the open field while lions and hyena\''s are roaming in the high grass. And a boat on water is even harder.<br/> <br/>Gip</td>', 'Wow, have no looked here in along time! Thanks for the review and the heads up. I did not read the challenge properly so your right on that and I apologise for that. Oh and it did not squirt as I was anticipating this to while the moving car was moving even closer to it. I also did not have much time to alter camera settings and it sure was not in the my menu settings on the 450d I use. I have more on flickr.com/gipukan/ but getting close to this bird is really hard in the open field while lions and hyena\''s are roaming in the high grass. And a boat on water is even harder. Gip', '2010-06-22 19:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
